cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "protein-selector"
abstract: >-
  An instructor tool for the Structural Bioinformatics Master's course
  (FHWN Tulln) that finds candidate proteins for MD, docking, and
  AlphaFold exercises and a-priori validates each candidate by running the
  real exercise pipelines against it, rather than relying on metadata
  proxies alone.
authors:
